            "value": "按循环这天应该是「%@」。只改这一天，不影响后面的循环。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rotation has “%@” for this day. Changes here apply to this day only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依循環，這天應為「%@」。調整只套用於當天，後續循環照常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
