            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当天的时间不能晚于上班时间；如果需要提前一晚，选择「前一天」。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same-day alarms must be at or before the shift starts. For the night before, choose Previous day."
